.SH NAME
gf-convert-prometheus-convert-prometheus-cortex-delete-namespace - Deletes all rule groups that were imported from prometheus compatible sources within the specified namespace


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf convert-prometheus convert-prometheus-cortex-delete-namespace [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Deletes all rule groups that were imported from prometheus compatible sources within the specified namespace

